# Spark language files

- `.spark` programs are line-oriented; `#` comments; `->` bindings; `|` pipelines
- Prefer gateway aliases in `model` lines (`fast`, `code`, `best`)
- Asm sources live under `asm/` (GAS **scaffold**); keep dry-run free of net I/O
- Authoring SoT **A+B+C** (`docs/SELF_HOST.md`): bootstrap/, sparkasm/, selfhost/
- HDL under `hdl/` is educational/stub unless CI proves otherwise
- Live HTTP / TLS / X11 are **companions** only (`spark-ask-http`,
  `spark-engine-fetch-tls`, `spark-engine-show`) — not the language
- Honesty: not full ES / full CSS / Google.com / Electron / full compiler
- After language changes: `make` then `make test` before claiming green
